[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:0.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:0.2", "PA_tha-ap_409:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Hemaka Chapter on Metteyya, Number Seven I was once a brahmin youth named Hemaka, A student of the Vedas, well-versed in the threefold knowledge. Having heard the fame of the Buddha, the Great Sage, I went forth into homelessness under the Jina’s dispensation. For twenty thousand years I practiced meditation, And for another ten thousand years I dwelt in the forest. Then, having attained the fruit of Arhatship, I became one who has done what was to be done. I have reached the end of birth and death; My holy life is lived, the task is accomplished. There is no further existence for me now; I am cooled, O King, like a lamp extinguished. This is the true history of the Elder Hemaka, Who dwelt in the forest, free from all defilements. Through this merit may I attain the state of Buddhahood, And may I be the savior of the world, as Metteyya is.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:1.1"], "en": "“Near Pabbhārakūṭa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:1.2"], "en": "a ascetic named Anoma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:1.3"], "en": "having constructed a well-made hermitage, lived there.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:1.4"], "en": "He then dwelt in a leaf-hut.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:2.1"], "en": "His work of asceticism was accomplished;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:2.2"], "en": "having attained success through his own power, he remained there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:2.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:2.4"], "en": "The sage, having transcended both the worldly and the monastic, ardent, wise,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:3.1"], "en": "and confident in his own doctrine.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:3.2"], "en": "Skilled in the doctrines of others,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:3.3"], "en": "he was proficient in the earth and the sky,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:3.4"], "en": "and skilled in the interpretation of omens.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:4.1"], "en": "Free from sorrow, free from undertakings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:4.2"], "en": "eating little, and without greed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:4.3"], "en": "content with both gain and loss.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:4.4"], "en": "A meditator, delighting in meditation, a sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:5.1"], "en": "The Fully Enlightened One named Piyaḍassī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:5.2"], "en": "the supreme, compassionate sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:5.3"], "en": "Desiring to ferry beings across,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:5.4", "PA_tha-ap_409:6.1"], "en": "he then suffused them with compassion upon seeing people who were ready to be awakened.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:6.2"], "en": "The great sage Piyaḍassī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:6.3"], "en": "having traveled even to a thousand world-systems,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:6.4"], "en": "gives instruction as a sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:7.1"], "en": "Desiring to lift me up,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:7.2"], "en": "he came to my hermitage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:7.3"], "en": "the Jina had not been seen by me before.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:7.4"], "en": "And it has not been heard by anyone else.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:8.1"], "en": "My portents, dreams,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:8.2"], "en": "and well-expounded marks have been revealed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:8.3"], "en": "A master of the paths on earth and in the sky,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:8.4"], "en": "skilled in the movements of the constellations,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:9.1"], "en": "I, having heard [the teaching] from the Buddha—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:9.2"], "en": "Therein I gladdened my mind;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:9.3"], "en": "whether standing or sitting,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:9.4"], "en": "I remember it at all times.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:10.1"], "en": "While I was thus recollecting him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:10.2"], "en": "the Blessed One too recollected me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:10.3"], "en": "for one who recollects the Buddha—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:10.4"], "en": "At that time, joy arose within me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:11.1"], "en": "Then, returning at the proper time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:11.2"], "en": "the Great Sage approached me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:11.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:11.4"], "en": "Even when he arrived, I did not know that this was the Buddha, the Great Sage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:12.1"], "en": "compassionate and merciful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:12.2", "PA_tha-ap_409:12.3"], "en": "The great sage Piyaḍassī made himself known:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:12.4"], "en": "“I am the Buddha in the world with its devas.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:13.1"], "en": "Having recognized the Sambuddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:13.2"], "en": "the Great Sage Piyadassī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:13.3"], "en": "and having gladdened his own heart,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:13.4"], "en": "I spoke these words:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:14.1"], "en": "“Others sit upon stools,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:14.2"], "en": "couches, and chairs;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:14.3"], "en": "\"You too, O All-Seeing One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:14.4"], "en": "sit upon this jeweled throne—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:15.1"], "en": "a seat composed of every kind of gem.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:15.2"], "en": "Having fashioned it instantly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:15.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:15.4"], "en": "I gave that creation by supernormal power to the Sage Piyadassi.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:16.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:16.2"], "en": "And as he sat upon a gem-studded throne created by psychic power,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:16.3"], "en": "a jambu fruit the size of a jar [fell].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:16.4"], "en": "At that time, I gave [it] to him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:17.1"], "en": "Having caused me to smile,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:17.2"], "en": "the Great Sage consumed it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:17.3"], "en": "Then, having gladdened my heart,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:17.4"], "en": "I paid homage to the Teacher.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:18.1"], "en": "But the Blessed One, Piyadassī—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:18.2"], "en": "The Eldest in the World, the Bull among Men,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:18.3"], "en": "seated upon his jewel throne,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:18.4"], "en": "spoke these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:19.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:19.2", "PA_tha-ap_409:19.3"], "en": "“I shall now proclaim the praises of him who gave me a jeweled seat and the fruit of immortality.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:19.4"], "en": "Listen to me as I speak:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:20.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:20.2"], "en": "for seventy-seven eons he will delight in the world of the gods.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:20.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:20.4"], "en": "And seventy-five times he will be a wheel-turning monarch;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:21.1"], "en": "thirty-two times he will be the lord of the gods.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:21.2"], "en": "He will exercise sovereignty over the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:21.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:21.4"], "en": "his regional sovereignty will be vast and beyond counting.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:22.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:22.2"], "en": "Many well-crafted couches made of gold, silver,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:22.3"], "en": "and even ruby.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:22.4", "PA_tha-ap_409:23.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:23.2"], "en": "One who possesses meritorious deeds will find a walking path made of jewels even as they walk.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:23.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:23.4"], "en": "Then many couches will surround him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:24.1"], "en": "there will be gabled houses and palaces.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:24.2"], "en": "And a costly bed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:24.3"], "en": "having understood his mind,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:24.4"], "en": "these will immediately come into being.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:25.1"], "en": "Sixty thousand elephants,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:25.2"], "en": "adorned with every ornament,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:25.3"], "en": "noble tuskers with golden girths—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:25.4"], "en": "Clad in golden-colored garments,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:26.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:26.2"], "en": "they were mounted by village chiefs who held spears and goads in their hands.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:26.3"], "en": "They shall attend upon him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:26.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of that jeweled seat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:27.1"], "en": "Sixty thousand horses,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:27.2"], "en": "Adorned with every ornament,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:27.3", "PA_tha-ap_409:27.4"], "en": "they were like noble Sindhu horses, swift in their course by birth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:28.1", "PA_tha-ap_409:28.2"], "en": "Mounted by village chiefs bearing spears and bows,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:28.3"], "en": "they too shall attend upon him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:28.4"], "en": "This is the fruit of the jeweled throne:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:29.1"], "en": "sixty thousand chariots,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:29.2"], "en": "adorned with every ornament.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:29.3"], "en": "There were torches and also tiger-skins;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:29.4"], "en": "they were armored and with banners raised high,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:30.1"], "en": "mounted by village chiefs.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:30.2", "PA_tha-ap_409:30.3"], "en": "They shall constantly attend upon me with mace-bearing warriors holding bows in their hands;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:30.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of that jeweled seat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:31.1"], "en": "Sixty thousand milch cows,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:31.2"], "en": "fit to be milked by bulls and leaders,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:31.3"], "en": "will bring forth their calves.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:31.4"], "en": "This is the fruit of the jeweled throne:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:32.1"], "en": "sixteen thousand women,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:32.2"], "en": "adorned with every ornament.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:32.3"], "en": "Wearing various garments and ornaments,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:32.4"], "en": "with jeweled earrings fastened,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:33.1"], "en": "having broad brows and long lashes, and smiling.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:33.2"], "en": "With beautiful and slender waists,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:33.3"], "en": "they shall constantly attend upon him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:33.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of the jeweled seat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:34.1"], "en": "In eighteen hundred kappas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:34.2"], "en": "there was one named Gotama, possessed of vision;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:34.3"], "en": "having dispelled that darkness,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:34.4"], "en": "\"A Buddha will appear in the world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:35.1"], "en": "Having come into his presence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:35.2"], "en": "I shall go forth, free from worldly attachments.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:35.3"], "en": "Having delighted the Teacher,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:35.4"], "en": "he will find joy in the teaching.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:36.1"], "en": "Having heard his Dhamma, [he will practice it].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:36.2"], "en": "He will destroy the defilements;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:36.3"], "en": "having fully understood all taints, he,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:36.4"], "en": "being without taints, will attain Nibbāna.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:37.1"], "en": "Energy is my yoke and burden,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:37.2"], "en": "the bearer of security from bondage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:37.3"], "en": "aspiring for the supreme goal, I shall exert myself.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:37.4"], "en": "I dwell within the Teaching.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:38.1"], "en": "This is my final one;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:38.2"], "en": "my last existence is now unfolding.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:38.3"], "en": "All taints are utterly destroyed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:38.4"], "en": "there is now no further becoming.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:39.1"], "en": "My defilements have been incinerated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:39.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:39.3"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:40.1"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:40.2", "PA_tha-ap_409:40.3"], "en": "... [and so on] ... the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:41.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges (paṭisambhidā) have been attained.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:41.2"], "en": "\"...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:41.3"], "en": "the Buddha's teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:42.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Hemaka speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:43.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Hemaka is the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_409:43.2"], "en": "The seventeenth section for recitation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
]
